---
const systems = [
  {
    era: "Shared broadcast",
    signal: "One scheduled program",
    path: ["limited national outlets", "simultaneous encounters", "shared conversation"],
    verdict: "Distribution helped create the public the chart measured.",
    tone: "broadcast",
  },
  {
    era: "Current chart",
    signal: "Many separate plays",
    path: ["private listening worlds", "counted sales and streams", "one aggregate rank"],
    verdict: "The rank can be accurate without producing common exposure.",
    tone: "chart",
  },
  {
    era: "Personal trail",
    signal: "One chosen door",
    path: ["record, artist or video", "related recommendation", "another useful door"],
    verdict: "Relationship replaces popularity as the organizing principle.",
    tone: "trail",
  },
];
---

<figure class="article-wide delivery-systems not-prose" aria-labelledby="delivery-title delivery-caption">
  <div class="delivery-systems__frame">
    <header>
      <p>THREE DELIVERY SYSTEMS</p>
      <h3 id="delivery-title">Same music. Different route into the room.</h3>
    </header>
    <ol>
      {systems.map((system, index) => (
        <li class={`delivery-systems__system delivery-systems__system--${system.tone}`}>
          <span class="delivery-systems__index">0{index + 1}</span>
          <div>
            <p>{system.era}</p>
            <h4>{system.signal}</h4>
            <ol aria-label={`${system.era} sequence`}>
              {system.path.map((step, stepIndex) => (
                <li>
                  <span>{step}</span>
                  {stepIndex < system.path.length - 1 && <b aria-hidden="true">→</b>}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ol>
            <p class="delivery-systems__verdict">{system.verdict}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="delivery-caption">
    The chart still counts consumption. What changed is its ability to force the same record through the same national doorway.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .delivery-systems {
    margin-block: 2.8rem !important;
  }

  .delivery-systems__frame {
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.6rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgb(209 187 130 / 0.28);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: #0b1112;
    box-shadow: 0.65rem 0.8rem 0 #030506;
  }

  header {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  header p,
  header h3 {
    margin: 0 !important;
  }

  header p {
    color: #d2a94d;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }

  header h3 {
    margin-top: 0.25rem !important;
    color: #f2ead8;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 3vw, 1.65rem) !important;
  }

  .delivery-systems__frame > ol {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .delivery-systems__system {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.13);
    border-left: 0.35rem solid var(--system-color);
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.035);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .delivery-systems__system--broadcast { --system-color: #cf553f; }
  .delivery-systems__system--chart { --system-color: #d2a94d; }
  .delivery-systems__system--trail { --system-color: #53b5b1; }

  .delivery-systems__index {
    color: var(--system-color);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .delivery-systems__system p,
  .delivery-systems__system h4 {
    margin: 0 !important;
  }

  .delivery-systems__system > div > p:first-child {
    color: var(--system-color);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .delivery-systems__system h4 {
    margin-top: 0.14rem !important;
    color: #f4eee2;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .delivery-systems__system ol {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0.65rem 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .delivery-systems__system ol li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 0 !important;
  }

  .delivery-systems__system ol span {
    padding: 0.3rem 0.42rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.13);
    color: #d7d1c6;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
  }

  .delivery-systems__system ol b {
    color: var(--system-color);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .delivery-systems__verdict {
    color: #aca69d;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .delivery-systems__system ol {
      display: grid;
    }

    .delivery-systems__system ol li {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .delivery-systems__system ol b {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      transform-origin: 0.6rem center;
    }
  }
</style>
